X:1
T:Through the Night of Doubt and Sorrow
T:REX GLORIAE
C:Music: Henry Thomas Smart, 1868 · Words: Bernhardt S. Ingemann, 1826. Translated by Sabine Baring-Gould, 1867
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "Appendix to Hymns Ancient and Modern", 1869 Hymn 293. Text is the same as "Concordia Hymnal" 1916.. No second score was available to cross-check the melody.
